     "@es": "**ev** = casa; **oda** = habitación; **mutfak** = cocina; **banyo** = baño.",
     "@en": "**ev** = house; **oda** = room; **mutfak** = kitchen; **banyo** = bathroom."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Para ubicar algo usa **-de/-da**: **evde** = en casa, **odada** = en la habitación.",
     "@en": "To locate something use **-de/-da**: **evde** = at home, **odada** = in the room."
    },
    {
